4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GTuN2VAM8dIQ7kNvwEf-tzM&_nc_oc=AdrPIDPHMbtorg8siJ3u7S914jmrbKZ1pXDFZ8kEzo8K7LQ4Q2q-FawdkjmxYTPu0Rs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCbriA_fxwQXdhEdZR94VKKwWEpK_GRaynLkrtvv46m6w&oe=6A6C9D54"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o1umpV353R0Q7kNvwE44pf1&_nc_oc=AdpPVnYaGbJqsG5cvRmuKSlre2s2C0Qno1GZQfPugt0eRBisqksTxEvEoSSvXRrCebI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQClDb70mBExO4Ndhj0dy2KhjLaDqMr7n8t-cKn0xv9CLg&oe=6A6CA232"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0CcLqicU1pMQ7kNvwH5B50Z&_nc_oc=AdqJAZcroGvlE5KFvEHO1Yz5ro9tgoRa7XSxBGhJ4TUH0i8kO-V1g9l5ehEs-JVzXL8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQC1k6lMjfeXdfvZH1NVsdIXq5A4o0d-81qfZ5BlNR5TKQ&oe=6A6CAFD5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p